     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hey guys.<br><br>In shinydashboard, if menuItem()s are declared in the sidebar, and tabItem()s in the body, choosing a menu item will display the respective tab item in the body.<br><br>However, most applications don&#39;t simply draw a graph, there is usually some form of input. Is it possible to put tab items in the sidebar as well as the body? My attempts so far have only managed to glitch the application.<br><br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">shinydashboard</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>header </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> dashboardHeader</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">title </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Test&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>sidebar </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> dashboardSidebar</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    sidebarMenu</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        menuItem</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;functions&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> tabName </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;functions&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        menuItem</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;files&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> tabName </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;files&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    tabItems(<br>        tabItem(tabName = &quot;functions&quot;<br>            ,selectizeInput(&quot;something&quot;, label = &quot;Only useful to the functions graph&quot;, choices = NULL, multiple = F) <br>        ),<br></span><span style=\"color:#000\"><code><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        tabItem(tabName = &quot;files&quot;<br>            ,selectizeInput(&quot;somethingelse&quot;, label = &quot;Only useful to the files graph&quot;, choices = NULL, multiple = F) <br>        )</span></code><br>    )</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>body </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> dashboardBody</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    tabItems</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        tabItem</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">tabName </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;functions&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>            h2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;test2&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>            </span><span style=\"color:#800\">#,some graph</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        </span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        tabItem</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">tabName </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;files&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>            h2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;testgfhdfgjdfjh&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><code><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>            </span><span style=\"color:#800\">#,some graph</span></code></span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        </span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>shinyUI</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    dashboardPage</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        header</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> sidebar</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> body<br>    </span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div></code></div><br><br></div>"
